      { name: 'Sarah Avery', title: 'Deputy Manager', based: 'Nursery office and honorary Bumblebee', qualifications: 'Level 4 Early Years', joined: '2003', favourite: 'Dressing up as different characters, dancing and sharing stories.', outside: 'Spending time with family and friends.' },
